            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695520101",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "这些人…就这么打牌？嘁~真没意思。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955202",
            "initDialog": "695520201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695520201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "进行「七圣召唤」的对局吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955203",
            "initDialog": "695520301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695520301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "暂时有别的事…"
                },
                {
                    "id": "695520302",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "你就要走了？嘿嘿嘿，我还没玩够呢，凭我的技术，肯定能再赢不少！"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955204",
            "initDialog": "695520401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695520401",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "果然是神通广大的桑歌玛哈巴依老爷赢了！"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955205",
            "initDialog": "695520501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695520501",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "等、等一下！我们再来一把，再来一局！"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955206",
            "initDialog": "695520601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695520601",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "好啊，没问题。让你见识一下桑歌玛哈巴依老爷打牌的功夫。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955208",
            "initDialog": "695520801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695520801",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "进行「七圣召唤」的对局吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955209",
            "initDialog": "695520901",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695520901",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "先调整一下卡组…"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955210",
            "initDialog": "695521001",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695521001",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "是我赢喽~我赢喽~又是我赢喽~"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955211",
            "initDialog": "695521101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695521101",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "这、这都能输，我到底在打什么呀…"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955212",
            "initDialog": "695521201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695521201",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "行呀！客人您都发话了，我当然愿意和您玩呀！嘿嘿嘿~"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955214",
            "initDialog": "695521401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695521401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "进行「七圣召唤」的对局吧。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955215",
            "initDialog": "695521501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695521501",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "先调整一下卡组…"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955216",
            "initDialog": "695521601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695521601",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "今天桑歌玛哈巴依老爷的运气真是挡不住啊。"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955217",
            "initDialog": "695521701",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695521701",
                    "speaker": "多莉",
                    "text": "我…我居然会在…卡牌游戏上输给别人…可恶！"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6955218",
            "initDialog": "695521801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "695521801",
